@Becoming.BlanketWeights.independentGiven_of_detailedBalance : ∀ {I B E : Type} (li : List I) (le : List E)
  (w : I → B → E → Nat) (rate : B → E → I → I → Nat) (adj : B → Becoming.«际» I),
